  m_Name: Text_BarnGuard_AfterReported
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.TextDialogueNode
  text: So you went to him. Fine. They'll walk me up the hill, and a sergeant will shout, and in a month I'll be on another gate. But the men I sold to don't get walked up any hill, worker. They don't forget a name either. Yours, for instance.
